# Only code, write-ups and small result tables go to GitHub.
# Raw sampled answers, label files, adapters, arrays and fitted models stay out: they are on Hugging Face
# (mild-rgb/lora-factory-experiments, experiment_3/) or local only.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# arrays, tensors, models
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.pkl
*.safetensors
# answers, labels, job files and id lists (some hold raw model answers)
*.jsonl
*_ids.txt
out/
features/
team/data/
queue/
models/
# run logs (some quote model answers)
*.log
# small tables that are safe and useful: keep
!granite_factory/team/many-loras-39/labels/lora_rates.jsonl
!granite_factory/team/many-loras-39/eval_log.jsonl
!granite_weights/team/many-loras-39/eval_log.jsonl
!granite_trial/out/
granite_trial/out/*
!granite_trial/out/summary_*.json
!granite_trial/out/summary_*.txt
!granite_prompt/out/
granite_prompt/out/*
!granite_prompt/out/summary.json
!granite_prompt/out/summary.txt
!granite_factory/out/
granite_factory/out/*
!granite_factory/out/stats_nojudge.txt
!granite_factory/out/summary_block0.txt
!granite_factory/out/factory.log
